  {"date": "2022-07-14", "venue": "Xfinity Center", "city": "Mansfield", "state": "MA", "gap": 5, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "> from \"CDT,\" another exceptional \"Plasma,\" arguably the best recent (2014) addition to the band's massive canon. Trey and Fish play as one, but, if interested in bypassing the (indeed euphoric) peak to lock in on \"peak\" Phish musicianship, listen four times as a means to follow each musician and his unique contributions. If nothing else, more evidence that Trey loves \"Plasma\" just as much as we do.", "out": "->", "prev": "Chalk Dust Torture", "in": "->", "next": "Weekapaug Groove", "nb": 1},
